| **Behance** | https://www.behance.net/search/projects/web%20design | In-depth brand systems, multi-page projects, typographic directions, art direction, page compositions, responsive explorations. | Assume a beautiful concept image is a working, accessible production site. |
| **Dribbble** | https://dribbble.com/search/web-design | Micro-layouts, component details, type treatments, hero concepts, cards, visual exploration. | Reproduce single-screen “shots” without testing real text, interactions, and small screens. |
| **Awwwards / UI design** | https://www.awwwards.com/websites/ui-design/ | High-craft editorial approaches, distinctive interactions, experimental storytelling, advanced use of imagery and motion. | Sacrifice load time, navigation, keyboard access or usability merely to look award-worthy. |
| **Lapa Ninja** | https://www.lapa.ninja/ | Real-world landing page structures, above-the-fold messaging, CTA placement, industry-specific hierarchy, section sequencing. | Clone the common template shared by many SaaS examples. |
